    <fr:title text="Agda Module System Parametrized by Dependency">Agda Module System Parametrized by Dependency</fr:title>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p>In Agda, if I add a definiton to a primitve file, all importers of
that file must recompile. However, if they could be informed by which
defintions they actually depend on, then there is the opportunity to
avoid this recompilation</html:p>
    <html:p>This may be a significant change to the interfaces, but I think it
would be worthwhile</html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
